@GameApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5254
@token = dan-token-tu-response-login-vao-day

### Đăng ký
POST {{GameApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sinhvien01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Đăng nhập
POST {{GameApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sinhvien01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Tạo nhân vật
POST {{GameApi_HostAddress}}/api/characters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hiep Si Rong",
  "class": "Warrior"
}

### Sửa nhân vật
PUT {{GameApi_HostAddress}}/api/characters/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hiep Si Rong",
  "class": "Warrior",
  "level": 5,
  "hp": 250
}
